// Directory Service, DFS Replication (SYSVOL) and DNS Server events on the domain controllers in the last day:
// the replication and SYSVOL events Learn's troubleshooting articles name (1311, 1925, 1988, 2042, 2213, 4012,
// 4013), and every error. Sent to the Event table by the Azure Monitor Agent's data collection rule.
Event
| where TimeGenerated > ago(1d)
| where Computer in ({DomainControllers})
| where EventID in (1311, 1925, 1988, 2042, 2213, 4012, 4013) or EventLevelName == "Error"
| summarize Count = count(), LastSeen = max(TimeGenerated), Sample = take_any(RenderedDescription) by Computer, EventLog, Source, EventID, EventLevelName
| order by LastSeen desc
